        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "用来骂人，那就没和你开过玩笑啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 23.505,
      "end": 28.92,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "中国民间还传说，初三夜晚是老楚娶亲的日子，",
      "score": 0.0241,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.171,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1725,
        "sc_delta": -0.0016,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "中国民间还传说：初三夜晚是老鼠娶亲的日子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 28.92,
      "end": 31.8,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "所以一般人家都早早的关灯睡觉，",
      "score": 0.0346,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1935,
        "sc_logprob": -0.201,
        "sc_delta": -0.0076,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.004,
        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所以，一般人家都早早的关灯睡。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 32.07,
      "end": 35.091,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "免得是骚乱了楚辈的好事。",
      "score": 0.2245,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2433,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2937,
        "sc_delta": -0.0505,
