        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "骚/烧",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "免得是烧乱了，储备的好事。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 35.103,
      "end": 38.688,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "还有那些啊，大年初三好吃老关心的，",
      "score": 0.4526,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.4239,
        "sc_logprob": -1.2662,
        "sc_delta": 0.1577,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.695,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "蛮有爱心啊！大年初三，好吃老关心的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 38.688,
      "end": 46.212,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "还是又是嘛好吃的。前天我们带大家去城里头去看了一下这个米花糖和麻糖是啷子做的。",
      "score": 0.0865,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0888,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0897,
        "sc_delta": -0.0009,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.189,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "还是有什么好吃的？前天我带大家去城里头去看了一下，这个米发糖和马桶是啷子做的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 46.373,
      "end": 49.175,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "今天我们继续去农村走一走，",
      "score": 0.4065,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0575,
        "sc_logprob": -1.0812,
        "sc_delta": -0.0237,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.489,
